DESCRIPTION:National Zinfandel Day celebrates the grape American wine spent
  a century and a half treating as its own\, until DNA tests placed its ori
 gin on the Croatian coast. The observance is held on the third Wednesday o
 f November\, which in 2026 is November 18. Its own history is already mudd
 led: the organization behind it announced a first Zinfandel Day for Novemb
 er 19\, 2010\, then later wrote that it created National Zinfandel Day in 
 2012.\n\nhttps://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/national-zinfandel-day/
